Secretary of War Pete Hegseth
:
Colombia is officially joining the Americas Counter Cartel Coalition (A3C).

I met with Minister of Defense Mora (
@mindefensa
) in Panama City today as we launched a new chapter in U.S.-Colombia defense cooperation.

